  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2026-19248:\n\tQDomDocument XML parsing is vulnerable to a remotely-triggerable denial-of-service crash when processing untrusted input.\n\nCVE-2026-11573:\n\tUncontrolled recursion in Qt's QDomDocument serialization (QtXml) lets deeply nested untrusted XML crash the app via stack exhaustion (DoS only).\n",
